{"seq":2,"slug":"latency-cost-trust-and-risk","title":"联合验证延迟、成本、信任与风险","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-product-discovery-validation/ai-feasibility-and-evals/latency-cost-trust-and-risk","wordCount":2517,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"联合验证延迟-成本-信任与风险\">联合验证延迟、成本、信任与风险</h1><p>一个输出质量很高的 AI 原型，仍可能因为等待十二秒打断工作流、每次成功任务消耗过多推理与人工复核、用户无法识别错误，或数据风险超过价值而不可行。发现阶段必须把这些约束一起测量，因为优化其中一项常会伤害另一项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>AI 产品可行性是质量、延迟、成本、信任和风险的联合区域，而不是五张互不相关的报表。更强模型可能提高质量却增加等待与成本；更多自动化可能减少操作却放大错误后果；展示完整推理细节可能增加信息，却未必真正改善信任校准。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>产品问题</th>\n<th>代表性指标</th>\n<th>典型硬门</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>质量</td>\n<td>结果是否足以推动任务</td>\n<td>量规得分、严重错误率</td>\n<td>高严重度错误为零</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延迟</td>\n<td>等待是否符合交互节奏</td>\n<td>首次反馈、端到端 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>p</mi><mn>95</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p50/p95</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\">50/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\">95</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mn>95</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p95</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\">95</span></span></span></span></span> 不超过任务预算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成本</td>\n<td>每个成功结果是否可持续</td>\n<td>推理、工具、人工、重试成本</td>\n<td>成功任务毛利达下限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>信任</td>\n<td>用户是否在正确时机依赖或核查</td>\n<td>采纳、复核、撤销、求助行为</td>\n<td>高风险动作必须确认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>风险</td>\n<td>谁可能受什么伤害</td>\n<td>风险事件、切片差异、数据暴露</td>\n<td>不可接受事件必须阻断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>先从<a href=\"capability-quality-and-task-boundary\">任务边界与质量</a>取得明确场景，再为每个场景写预算。异步研究任务可以等待数分钟，实时辅助输入可能只有数百毫秒；内部草稿与自动发送给客户的风险门完全不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"测量用户感知延迟\">测量用户感知延迟</h2><p>只记录模型 API 响应时间会漏掉上传、检索、工具调用、排队、重试、流式渲染和人工复核。端到端延迟应从用户动作开始，到可用于下一步的结果结束。</p>\n<p>至少记录：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>首次可理解反馈时间，而不只是首个字节；</li>\n<li>完整结果时间；</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mn>95</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p95</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\">95</span></span></span></span></span> 和超时比例，而非只有平均值；</li>\n<li>每个阶段的耗时与重试次数；</li>\n<li>用户在等待期间是否切换任务、重复提交或放弃；</li>\n<li>高峰和最差输入切片的表现。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>平均五秒可能意味着大多数两秒、少数三十秒；后者足以破坏信任。对交互式任务，应原型化进度、取消、局部结果和异步通知，观察这些设计是否真的改善流程，而不是用动画掩盖不可接受等待。</p>\n<p>延迟预算可按任务阶段拆分：输入处理、检索、模型、工具、校验和呈现。若总预算为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>，各阶段预算为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">l_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则必须满足：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_i l_i \\le L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0197em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>预算不是平均目标，而应配分位数和超时策略。某阶段超过预算时要决定降级、缓存、并行、换模型还是转异步，不能无限等待“更聪明”的结果。</p>\n<h2 id=\"计算每个成功任务的真实成本\">计算每个成功任务的真实成本</h2><p>按调用成本计算会低估失败、重试和人工。更有用的指标是每个达到用户质量门槛的成功任务成本：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{success} = \\frac{C_{inference} + C_{tools} + C_{storage} + C_{review} + C_{support}}{N_{accepted}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ccess</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">cce</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">in</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ce</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oo</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pp</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{accepted}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">cce</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是被用户或量规接受的结果数量，不是请求总数。若低质量结果需要重跑三次，成本和延迟都必须计入；若用户要花十分钟修改，时间也属于价值账。</p>\n<p>为主要输入切片分别计算。长文档、多工具代理、罕见语言和高风险复核可能有完全不同成本。平均成本可能被大量简单任务稀释，却让最有价值的任务亏损。</p>\n<p>发现阶段可以使用区间而非伪精确预测：模型价格可能变化，缓存和批量也尚未优化。但必须做敏感性分析，例如价格下降一半、质量门提高、重试率增加或人工复核无法减少时，业务是否仍成立。只有依赖未来成本下降才能成立的产品，应把它列为核心假设。</p>\n<h2 id=\"让信任校准而不是最大化\">让信任校准而不是最大化</h2><p>目标不是让用户“更信任 AI”，而是让依赖程度与真实能力匹配。过低信任会浪费价值，过高信任会放大错误。可观察的校准行为包括：用户在高风险时查看来源、在低风险时不过度复核、发现异常后能撤销、知道何时求助人工。</p>\n<p>Google PAIR 的<a href=\"https://pair.withgoogle.com/guidebook-v2/chapter/feedback-controls/\">反馈与控制指南</a>强调，AI 不会在每次情境都完美，产品应允许用户调整、编辑或关闭输出，并在早期提供人工保险。发现实验应验证这些控制是否被理解和使用，而不是只询问“你信任这个系统吗”。</p>\n<p>可以设计成对场景：同样任务分别展示有来源与无来源、可撤销与不可撤销、明确限制与“智能助手”宣传，然后观察复核和采用。不要把更多解释文字自动当成更透明；如果用户看不懂、不会行动，解释没有完成任务。</p>\n<p>特别警惕拟人化。用户可能把流畅语言误认为知识完整，把自信语气误认为概率很高。界面应围绕能力边界、来源、状态和控制设计，而不是把系统塑造成不会犯错的人类专家。</p>\n<h2 id=\"用风险场景决定自动化上限\">用风险场景决定自动化上限</h2><p>风险分析从受影响者与后果开始，不从“模型有没有安全过滤”开始。列出直接用户、被输出提及的人、运营人员和无法选择退出的第三方；对每类人描述可预见伤害、严重度、发生条件、可检测性和补救路径。</p>\n<p>NIST 的 <a href=\"https://www.nist.gov/itl/ai-risk-management-framework\">AI 风险管理框架页面</a>在 2026 年仍明确将可信性纳入 AI 产品的设计、开发、使用和评估，并说明框架正在修订。其生成式 AI 配套资料将治理、映射、测量和管理贯穿生命周期。小团队可据此建立轻量风险登记，而不必等到发布前才做清单审查。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>风险</th>\n<th>发现阶段测试</th>\n<th>产品边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>虚构事实导致错误决定</td>\n<td>高代价边界样本、来源核对</td>\n<td>无来源不行动，保留人工确认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>敏感数据泄漏</td>\n<td>数据流走查、最小输入试点</td>\n<td>默认脱敏、短保留、限制日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不公平差异</td>\n<td>按受影响群体切片评测</td>\n<td>差异超门槛则不自动执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提示注入或工具滥用</td>\n<td>对抗输入、权限隔离测试</td>\n<td>最小权限、动作确认、沙箱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>操作者过度依赖</td>\n<td>失败情境观察、撤销测试</td>\n<td>清楚限制、复核点和升级路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>人工审核负担</td>\n<td>礼宾工时、告警命中率</td>\n<td>若审核不可规模化则缩小范围</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>风险高且难检测时，自动化上限应更低。产品可以先做证据整理、候选建议或差异标注，而不做最终决定或不可逆动作。缩小边界往往比增加一个免责声明更有效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"设计联合可行性矩阵\">设计联合可行性矩阵</h2><p>为每个关键任务和用户切片填一行，记录质量、延迟、成本、控制和风险是否过门。只有所有硬门都通过，任务才进入候选交付范围。</p>\n<p>例如：短邮件摘要质量和延迟达标、成本低、错误可编辑，可以自动生成；合同风险建议质量较高但严重遗漏难发现，则只能提供带引用的辅助检查；跨系统自动发信即使质量好，因工具权限和不可逆性尚未验证，也应停留在草稿确认。</p>\n<p>联合矩阵还能揭示优化方向。如果质量不足但用户价值强，继续评测原型；质量达标但成本太高，测试更小模型、缓存或缩短任务；信任不足，改心智模型与控制；风险不可接受，缩小任务或停止。</p>\n<p>不要用一个总体分数把硬门平均掉。矩阵的价值是保留不能交换的约束，并让团队知道“为什么还不能交付”。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见误区\">常见误区</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>误区</th>\n<th>隐藏的问题</th>\n<th>纠正动作</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>只测模型 API 延迟</td>\n<td>忽略检索、工具、重试和呈现</td>\n<td>测用户动作到可用结果的端到端分位数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按请求计算成本</td>\n<td>失败与人工复核被漏掉</td>\n<td>计算每个被接受成功任务成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>把信任当满意度</td>\n<td>用户可能满意却过度依赖</td>\n<td>观察核查、撤销、编辑和升级行为</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用免责声明处理高风险</td>\n<td>责任与伤害仍存在</td>\n<td>缩小自动化、增加硬门和人工确认</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用平均质量抵消严重错误</td>\n<td>稀有高影响失败被掩盖</td>\n<td>严重度硬门和切片评测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>假设模型价格必然下降</td>\n<td>商业模型依赖不可控未来</td>\n<td>做敏感性分析并设置停止条件</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>AI 产品只有落在质量、延迟、成本、信任和风险的共同可行区域内，才值得从发现进入交付。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>按真实任务节奏设置端到端延迟分位数预算；</li>\n<li>以被接受的成功任务为分母计算全成本；</li>\n<li>让用户依赖与能力匹配，而不是追求最大信任；</li>\n<li>从受影响者和伤害场景决定自动化上限；</li>\n<li>为不同任务与切片维护联合可行性矩阵；</li>\n<li>不允许平均分抵消任何高严重度硬门。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些门槛需要在可重复原型中执行。下一步是构建<a href=\"eval-driven-prototypes\">评测驱动的原型</a>，让每次模型、提示、工具和交互变化都有可比较证据。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"联合验证延迟、成本、信任与风险","id":"联合验证延迟-成本-信任与风险"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"测量用户感知延迟","id":"测量用户感知延迟"},{"level":2,"text":"计算每个成功任务的真实成本","id":"计算每个成功任务的真实成本"},{"level":2,"text":"让信任校准而不是最大化","id":"让信任校准而不是最大化"},{"level":2,"text":"用风险场景决定自动化上限","id":"用风险场景决定自动化上限"},{"level":2,"text":"设计联合可行性矩阵","id":"设计联合可行性矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"常见误区","id":"常见误区"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"用任务边界定义 AI 能力与质量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-product-discovery-validation/ai-feasibility-and-evals/capability-quality-and-task-boundary"},"next":{"title":"用评测驱动原型替代演示驱动开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/indie-app-shipping/ai-product-discovery-validation/ai-feasibility-and-evals/eval-driven-prototypes"}}